                <p style="font-style:italic;">"From darkness the first being was born, and to darkness it came back to when, buried in guilt and shame, he became a god of stone in his throne of thorns, an old, forgotten krate."</p>
                <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--text-muted);">— First page of the book of Ahn.</p>
            </div>
