                Nira kaelna ta' lyse ahn<br>
                hataelyrion, ir kei kaelna<br>
                y'le tahakoi kei, hakaji esh<br>
                arkel ir murvel, y'le<br>
                hatrayse uden su' karn esh<br>
                y'le'ri 'rek su' akin,<br>
                maeni'na, harnine Kar'e.<br><br>
                <strong style="color:var(--text-muted); font-style:normal; font-size:0.85rem;">Isha drenin su’ ta’ Ahn vynar</strong>
